<div class="eng"><div class="lab">GESHE MICHAEL'S ENGLISH (VERBATIM)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s362S"><span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s362w1">Coveting</span> consists of a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s362w2">wrong</span> (<span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s362p1">that is</span>, an <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s362f1">improper</span>) <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s362w5">desire</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s362p2">for</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s362w3">another</span>&#x27;s <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s362w4">wealth</span>, which <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s362p3">leads to</span> a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s362w8">wish</span> that one <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s362w7">make</span> it his <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s362w6">own</span>. <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s362w9"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s362m1">Harmful</span> <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s362m2">intent</span></span> is the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s362w13">desire</span> to <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s362w12">hurt</span> another <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s362w10">living being</span>, a desire which comes from the attitude of <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s362w11">hating</span> him. And <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s362w17"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s362m4">mistaken</span> <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s362m5">view</span></span> is the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s362w16">idea</span> that neither <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s362w14">virtue</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s362p4">nor</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s362w15">non-<span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s362m3">virtue</span></span> even exists. Next we discuss the literal meaning of the expression &quot;a path of action.&quot; 79 Explanation of the Expression &quot;Path of Action&quot;</span>
